ob ve filename text source be input ya
su name provider auto discharge ob bool lie ya

exists su name archetype hook generator mind be mind as name "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext text "You prepare short hook hints for stage-based spiritual manuscript generation." ya
exists su name archetype hook verifier mind be mind as name "qwen3.5:9b" fromtext text "You strictly select the strongest stage-fitting hooks from a candidate list." ya

exists su name stage prompt template ob text quoted.text.You are preparing hook hints for a spiritual hymn manuscript generator.

Stage name: [[stage_name]]

What this stage does:
[[stage_role]]

Task:
Read the source text and produce 8 to 12 short hook hints for this stage.

Rules:
- output only hook hints
- one hook hint per line
- no numbering
- no bullet points
- 3 to 7 words is preferred
- use source wording when possible
- small faithful variations are allowed
- make them singable and memorable
- avoid writing full lyrics
- avoid explanations

Source:
[[source]].text.quoted be text ya

exists su name stage verify template ob text quoted.text.You are selecting the strongest stage hooks.

Stage name:
[[stage_name]]

Stage role:
[[stage_role]]

Candidate hooks:
[[candidate_hooks]]

Task:
- select top stage-fitting hooks
- preserve source faithfulness
- prefer concise memorable phrasing

Output rules:
- return 3 or 4 hooks
- one hook per line
- no numbering
- no bullet points
- no labels
- no explanations
- no markdown
- keep each hook to 3 to 9 words where possible..text.quoted be text ya

exists su name replacement stage name ob text "" be text ya
exists su name replacement stage role ob text "" be text ya
exists su name replacement source text ob text "" be text ya
exists su name replacement candidate hooks ob text "" be text ya

su name replacements be map def
  su text "[[stage_name]]" ob name text replacement stage name ya
  su text "[[stage_role]]" ob name text replacement stage role ya
  su text "[[source]]" ob name text replacement source text ya
  su text "[[candidate_hooks]]" ob name text replacement candidate hooks ya
prah

exists su name text paragraph break ob text quoted.text.

.text.quoted be text ya

su name stage hook run from text stage name with text stage role to name text stage hooks out be ceremony def
  ob text of from of this to name text replacement stage name be text do
  ob text of with of this to name text replacement stage role be text do
  ob name text source text to name text replacement source text be text do

  su name stage prompt stage ob name map replacements in name text stage prompt template to name text stage prompt be instead do
  su name stage candidate hooks stage ob name text stage prompt for name archetype hook generator mind to name text stage candidate hooks by num 0 atmost num 240 be write do

  ob name text stage candidate hooks to name text replacement candidate hooks be text do
  su name stage verify prompt stage ob name map replacements in name text stage verify template to name text stage verify prompt be instead do
  su name stage hooks selected stage ob name text stage verify prompt for name archetype hook verifier mind to name text stage hooks out by num 0 atmost num 140 be write do

  su name stage hooks out ret
prah

su name story archetype hook refinery run be refinery def
  su name source load stage from filename of ob of source become wo text to name text source text be read do

  su name seed hooks stage from text "seed" with text "This stage introduces the core idea in its first living form. It names the central truth or possibility before it is tested. It should feel simple, clear, and foundational." to name text seed hooks be stage hook run do
  su name awake hooks stage from text "awake" with text "This stage is the awakening or activation of the seed. It shows invitation, opening, encouragement, inner prompting, or the beginning of movement. It should feel like the idea is becoming alive and possible." to name text awake hooks be stage hook run do
  su name challenge hooks stage from text "challenge" with text "This stage shows what resists, tests, blocks, or distorts the teaching. It includes fear, confusion, judgment, separation, false belief, pain, or misuse. It should feel like the teaching is being brought into tension." to name text challenge hooks be stage hook run do
  su name experience hooks stage from text "experience" with text "This stage shows the teaching being lived, felt, or worked through. It is the actual experience of engaging the challenge and moving within the teaching. It should feel embodied, active, and present." to name text experience hooks be stage hook run do
  su name integrated self hooks stage from text "integrated self" with text "This stage shows the self after learning has taken root. It expresses stable inner understanding, identity, clarity, sovereignty, transparency, or mature selfhood. It should feel settled, centred, and true." to name text integrated self hooks be stage hook run do
  su name transformation hooks stage from text "transformation" with text "This stage shows the self or situation being changed. It includes release, forgiveness, purification, healing, transmutation, or deep inner turning. It should feel like something real is being altered." to name text transformation hooks be stage hook run do
  su name highway hooks stage from text "highway" with text "This stage shows the onward path after transformation. It expresses the new mode of being, the continuing walk, the opened road, or the settled path forward. It should feel spacious, steady, and complete." to name text highway hooks be stage hook run do

  su name output start stage ob text "[seed]" to name text output be text do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text seed hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[awake]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text awake hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[challenge]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text challenge hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[experience]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text experience hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[integrated self]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text integrated self hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[transformation]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text transformation hooks to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob text "[highway]" to name output be plus do
  ob name text paragraph break to name output be plus do
  ob name text highway hooks to name output be plus do

  ob name text output be write do
prah

from name story archetype hook refinery run to name text result be refinery do
ob name result be write do
